  "section": "Story Summary #10 of 10",
  "description": "The misshapen Palpatine exhorts Luke to give into his hate, to battle and destroy his own father. A spectacular Lightsaber duel ensues, with the young Jedi finally forcing Darth Vader to his knees. But the son refuses to slay his father, infuriating the Emperor. Palpatine responds by blasting Luke with Force lightning...a move that results in Vader's ultimate redemption. The Dark Lord turns on his evil master and hurls him to certain death, forfeiting his own life. With the destruction of the shield generator on Yavin, the Rebel fleet dramatically achieves its objective. Luke and his friends celebrate the end of Palpatine's reign, even as the Force spirits of Yoda, Obi-Wan Kenobi, and Anakin Skywalker look on serenely."
